{
  "expected_payment": {
    "text": "As of November 2, 2023, Disney expected to pay NBCUniversal approximately USD 8.61 billion on or before December 1, 2023, assuming the full approximately USD 567 million in outstanding capital call contributions remained unpaid on the payment date. Any reduction in that unpaid balance would increase the initial payment.",
    "citations": [
