      }
    ]
  },
  "valuation_basis": {
    "text": "The agreement valued NBCUniversal’s stake at its ownership share of the greater of Hulu’s equity fair value or the USD 27.5 billion guaranteed floor for all of Hulu’s equity. NBCUniversal owned 33%, subject to dilution under certain circumstances. Its share of the floor yielded the gross guaranteed purchase price of approximately USD 9.17 billion.",
    "citations": [
      {
        "passage_id": "P2",
        "quote": "67% by Disney and 33% by NBCU, subject to dilution under certain circumstances"
      },
      {
        "passage_id": "P2",
        "quote": "the greater of Hulu’s equity fair value or a guaranteed floor value of $27.5 billion"
      }
    ]
  },
  "appraisal_and_uncertainty": {
    "text": "The final purchase price was not known as of November 2, 2023. The agreed appraisal would determine Hulu’s equity fair value as of September 30, 2023. If that value exceeded the floor, Disney would pay NBCUniversal its ownership share of the appraised value less the gross guaranteed purchase price within 45 days of the final determination. Separately, Disney would share 50% of its estimated U.S. tax savings from the acquisition, with payments expected primarily over 15 years. The filing did not quantify those payments.",
